"set :ref:`AVOID_ENABLE <AVOID_ENABLE>` = 7 (\"All\") to use all sources of "
"barrier information including \"Proximity\" sensors"
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`AVOID_ENABLE <AVOID_ENABLE>` = 7（「All」）设置为使用所有障碍物信息来源，包括「近距」传感器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:65
#: 846c7511a58444119bb19e85744cfb28 c3c2234f620b41b4994b11297c261e5d
#: f9b46827d0a54707b4675c89659c141e
msgid ""
"set :ref:`PRX1_TYPE <PRX1_TYPE>` to a 360 deg Lidar type being used or = 4, "
"to enable using a range finders as a \"proximity sensor\""
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`PRX1_TYPE <PRX1_TYPE>` 设置为正在使用的360度激光雷达类型，或设置为4以启用将测距仪作为「近距传感器」使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:66
#: 1b8c5497425545af99be69fa75235e3a 49c37824bb154352b404f426fe185e70
#: e914d85f222343c4ae4a1b5a93823249
msgid "in :ref:`Loiter <loiter-mode>`"
msgstr "在 :ref:`Loiter <loiter-mode>` 模式下"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:68
#: 9ee09d7b7d83488b9ad654ee2cf06864 c3aeb00e7b3746ffa59318560e9882e5
#: fecd659aed364197b4c1b91edab08e9a
msgid ""
":ref:`AVOID_MARGIN <AVOID_MARGIN>` controls how many meters from the barrier"
" the vehicle will attempt to stop or try to slide along it"
msgstr ":ref:`AVOID_MARGIN <AVOID_MARGIN>` 控制飞行器将在距障碍物多少米处尝试停止或沿其滑行。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:69
#: 437a5c7a6c9849dcb472ad9ad34c4b22 473a9ea91de448f284ab795f88bb0a34
#: b62c7f3d5d5447eb9402ae4c5040bf35
msgid ""
":ref:`AVOID_BEHAVE <AVOID_BEHAVE>` allows setting whether the vehicle should"
" simply Stop in front of the barrier or Slide around it. This parameter only"
" affects Copter, since Rover always stops."
msgstr ""
":ref:`AVOID_BEHAVE <AVOID_BEHAVE>` "
"允许设置飞行器应在障碍物前简单停止还是绕过它滑行。此参数仅影响Copter，Rover始终停止。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:72
#: 21241ce5886e43d4aef5760740c7e938 4fff04e4e80f44c2884b1325e01670f3
#: 5e67baff7e0443c38ed586a68695ad83
